<title>USA: Kirby Corp Q1 shr $0.19 vs $0.20.</title>
<headline>Kirby Corp Q1 shr $0.19 vs $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.19		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net		 4,739		    5,240</p>
<p> Revs		98,456		   92,407</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  24,904		   26,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: The 1997 first quarter included a $2 million redemption of Universal Insurance Co common stock and a $1.039 distribution from a marine partnership totaling $0.12 per share. The Universal redemption reduced Kirby's voting common stock ownership in the Puerto Rican property and casualty insurer from 47 percent to 45 percent.</p>
